          "type": "paragraph",
          "item": {
            "text": "<p><strong>THAT&nbsp;</strong>the&nbsp;registered&nbsp;office&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;Company&nbsp;be&nbsp;and&nbsp;is&nbsp;hereby&nbsp;changed&nbsp;with&nbsp;immediate&nbsp;effect&nbsp;to:</p><p> </p><p><span class=\"q-placeholder\" data-text=\"NEW_REGISTERED_ADDRESS\" data-value=\"\" contenteditable=\"false\">{{NEW_REGISTERED_ADDRESS}}</span></p><p> </p><p>THAT&nbsp;the&nbsp;Company&#39;s&nbsp;Secretarial&nbsp;Agent&nbsp;be&nbsp;hereby&nbsp;authorised&nbsp;and&nbsp;instructed&nbsp;to&nbsp;lodge&nbsp;the&nbsp;above&nbsp;forms&nbsp;via&nbsp;ACRA&nbsp;electronic&nbsp;filing&nbsp;system&nbsp;Bizfile,&nbsp;accordingly.</p><p> </p><p>DATED:&nbsp;<span class=\"q-placeholder\" data-text=\"DATE\" data-value=\"\" contenteditable=\"false\">{{DATE}}</span></p><p> </p>",
